1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,511
One thing in this picture costs you a whole day in Japan.

2
00:00:03,511 --> 00:00:05,790
Three things to sort before you land.

3
00:00:05,790 --> 00:00:06,906
One. Your suitcase.

4
00:00:06,906 --> 00:00:08,492
Japan will move it for you.

5
00:00:08,492 --> 00:00:14,132
You hand it in at your hotel in the morning, and it's waiting at the next one the following day.

6
00:00:14,132 --> 00:00:17,950
About three thousand yen, and you take the train with just a bag.

7
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:19,259
Two. Your bank card.

8
00:00:19,259 --> 00:00:22,596
Japanese bank machines won't take a card from home.

9
00:00:22,596 --> 00:00:26,980
The cash machines inside seven eleven will, and they run all night.

10
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:28,526
Three. The last train.

11
00:00:28,526 --> 00:00:33,727
It goes around midnight, and nothing runs again until five in the morning.

12
00:00:33,727 --> 00:00:36,890
After ten, a taxi adds twenty percent on top.

13
00:00:36,890 --> 00:00:38,670
Save this for your Japan trip.
